  m_Name: StoppingBleeds
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Quest
  title: Stopping Bleeds
  description: 'Sometimes you really get hit hard and start to bleed. Not to worry
    though, you won''t bleed out, but you''ll keep taking damage if you don''t stop
    it.

    Just whip out a bandage when this happens, you''ll be fine, unless you
    forget to bring them. Then you might die.'
  traderReputationReward: 100
